# The plumb (GEAR.md G4): the crags plumb's core in the scanner's frame. A scan
# marks where each machine coming for the player will be when it tells its next
# blow: a ring of lens light on the ground between them.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/plumb.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --fit=scanner_lens,mod_plumb
coast calm
place open_coast
wait 1.0
spawn runner
await noticed 10
# Away from it at a run, so it comes on from a few tiles off, and the scan.
walk -1,0.3 1.2 run
tap ability_scan
await ability:scan 5
wait 0.15
shot 01-where-it-will-strike with mob:runner
